@startuml
[*] --> Inserted : card inserted
Inserted : entry / nil
Inserted : do / prompt user to enter PIN / PIN_Entered

PIN_Entered : entry / login
PIN_Entered : do / verify PIN against stored information / PIN_Validated
PIN_Validated : entry / login
PIN_Validated : do / provide options to user / Options_Displayed
Options_Displayed : entry / login
Options_Displayed : do / process withdrawal request / Withdrawal_Processing
Withdrawal_Processing : entry / login
Withdrawal_Processing : do / dispense cash / Cash_Dispensed
Cash_Dispensed : entry / login
Cash_Dispensed : do / print receipt for transaction / Receipt_Printed
Receipt_Printed : entry / login
Receipt_Printed : do / return user's card / Card_Returned

Card_Returned --> Reset : system reset and ready for next user
Reset : entry / nil
Reset : do / become ready for the next user / [*]

PIN_Entered --> Error : invalid PIN (missing detail)
Error : entry / login
Error : do / handle error / Inserted

state J1 <<choice>>
Options_Displayed --> J1 : user selects option
Withdrawal_Processing --> J1 : user approves withdrawal request
J1 --> Cash_Dispensed
Cash_Dispensed --> Receipt_Printed
Receipt_Printed --> Card_Returned
Card_Returned --> Reset
Reset --> [*]
@enduml
